{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37461","headline":"八月十六日夜月 · 唐彦谦","name":"八月十六日夜月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"断肠佳赏固难期，昨夜销魂更不疑。\n丹桂影空蟾有露，绿槐阴在鹊无枝。\n赖将吟咏聊惆怅，早是疎顽耐别离。\n堪恨贾生曾恸哭，不缘清景爲忧时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}